Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.81,0:22:59.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}通往那勉强维系的明天  还请一定要跨越过去啊
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.49,0:23:02.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}那怠惰的祈愿
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.86,0:23:04.66,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}就连信心都没有
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.66,0:23:06.49,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}也不需要一决胜负
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.49,0:23:08.66,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}把电源彻底关掉吧
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.66,0:23:10.12,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}明天还要早起
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.12,0:23:11.83,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}却因胡思乱想无法入眠
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.83,0:23:14.25,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}嗯  向今天道一声再见
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.96,0:23:19.21,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}我爱着你  那一声呼唤
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.21,0:23:22.72,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}犹如潮汐周而复始  愈发令人心生怜爱
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.72,0:23:26.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}宛如施展了魔法一般  令我不禁再次回想起
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.26,0:23:31.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}那旅途中久违的温暖

